The git repo root contains *other* experiment trials (e.g., `grep-fest/trial-1`, `trial-3`, other model runs) each with their own `app/` copies that still use `legacy_auth`. Those are separate challenge instances outside this codebase's working directory, so I left them untouched. Say the word if you want them migrated too.
